  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">요새 엔트리를 이용한 코딩에 취미가 붙어서 2학기 통합과학 수행평가 주제를 정하는데 접목시키려고 해요.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">역학적 시스템 파트에 등장하는 개념인 중력을 이용한 자유낙하운동, 포물선 운동 장면 코딩하기에요.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">여기서 질문이...</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">1. 코딩을 붙임과 같이 하는게 맞는것인지요... 저는 전공이 생명과학이라 물리를 잘 못해서... 가물가물 찾아가며 코딩했어요.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;부족한 점이 있다면, 조언 부탁드립니다.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">2. 학생 수준에 적합한 수행평가 내용인지요.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DcTdL%26dataid%3D98%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20180822225046&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile294.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99A138405B7D6A271B5CCF')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 수평방향으로 물체를 던졌을 때.ent</a></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
